      "content": "what do you mean by \"letting myself rest\"? i dont mean a nap or anything. i mean like... if i wasn't even here, she wouldnt have to deal with any of this. the stress, the cleanup, the constant worrying. wouldn't that be the most peaceful thing for her? just having her life back?",
